SaffronCity_Dojo_Text_MasterKoichiIntro::
    .string "Hoo-hah!\p"
    .string "I am BRUNO!\n"
    .string "I was once a member of the\l"
    .string "ELITE FOUR!\p"
    .string "But I realized my physical training\n"
    .string "was still incomplete! I came to\l"
    .string "this DOJO to push my limits!\p"
    .string "You wish to challenge us?\n"
    .string "Expect no mercy from my fists!\p"
    .string "Hoo-hah!$"

SaffronCity_Dojo_Text_MasterKoichiDefeat::
    .string "What?\n"
    .string "My raw power… defeated?$"

SaffronCity_Dojo_Text_ChoosePrizedFightingMon::
    .string "I see now!\p"
    .string "My training is still lacking.\n"
    .string "You have true fighting spirit!\p"
    .string "I beseech you, do not take\n"
    .string "our DOJO's emblem as your trophy!\p"
    .string "In return, I will give you a prized\n"
    .string "FIGHTING POKéMON!\p"
    .string "Choose whichever one you like!$"

SaffronCity_Dojo_Text_StayAndTrainWithUs::
    .string "Hoo-hah!\n"
    .string "You should stay and lift weights\l"
    .string "with us!$"

